                                                "sense_id": "2827a78a-caec-3f4c-a85f-734b47cac2bd",
                                                "text": "As a young composer, he wandered for years in the desert of atonalism and then, following the example of John Cage, he detoured through the wilderness of music based on an aesthetic of randomness and anarchy."
